<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ThinkOmni</span>: Lifting Textual Reasoning to Omni-modal Scenarios via Guidance Decoding</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
